[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    119[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 150, 200 items), `exactly_one_hundred_items`,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    120[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `beyond_the_limit_ignores_the_tail`. Changing the cap to 99 failed 3 tests.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    121[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    122[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ### 6. Output formatting and exit status
